# PR triage, 2026-08-13 — the 15 PRs open from 2026-08-06 to 2026-08-10

Companion to #514's round (which reconciled #489/#490/#493/#498/#499). Same
rules: nothing merged as written, nothing closed whose data exists nowhere else,
stale claims corrected in place with a date rather than deleted, every figure
below counted or read out of committed data rather than recalled.

Every "already on main" claim in the SUPERSEDED table was checked by reading the
file on `origin/main`, and every ancestry claim with
`git merge-base --is-ancestor <sha> origin/main`.

